Script Fury reads a screenplay, breaks it into scenes and generates storyboard frames for each one. It's one of my first full-stack AI products, built with a FastAPI backend and a Next.js front end, and iterated through three versions in a single month.

A sibling project, a screenplay analysis platform, let writers email in scripts and get AI coverage and chat-based feedback back.
